      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for libsoup",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for libsoup fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-85197: heap use-after-free in HTTP/2 `client on_data_read()` via `GOAWAY` during body upload (bsc#1279238).\n- CVE-2026-85534: heap buffer overflow in `SoupSession` through `on_data_source_read_callback()` via `SETTINGS` frame\n  with crafted `INITIAL_WINDOW_SIZE` (bsc#1279239).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
